{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1028688-i-might-have-fucked-up-i-need-advices-asap","id":1028688,"title":"I might have Fucked Up. I need advices asap","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-08T14:17:49-08:00","id":1028688,"title":"I might have Fucked Up. I need advices asap","content":"So....one of my PC's eat the Apple of Adam and her arete was jumpstarted. now she has arete 7 and i just realized the implications.<br /> <br /> Any advices?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T14:25:30-08:00","id":1028691,"title":"","content":"Make it temporary. Instant enlightenment is a lot harder to hold onto than one the character worked for. Plus, if she only got the increase from eating the apple, she has an Experience Point debt she hasn't paid. Does she have a lump sum of XP that would cover the dots? If not, then she'll start losing it until she gets it down to a level she has or can pay for. And depending on where she was before she ate the apple, it's probably going to be a lot.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T14:28:21-08:00","id":1028692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bluecho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1028688-i-might-have-fucked-up-i-need-advices-asap?p=1028691#post1028691\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Make it temporary. Instant enlightenment is a lot harder to hold onto than one the character worked for. Plus, if she only got the increase from eating the apple, she has an Experience Point debt she hasn't paid. Does she have a lump sum of XP that would cover the dots? If not, then she'll start losing it until she gets it down to a level she has or can pay for. And depending on where she was before she ate the apple, it's probably going to be a lot.</div> </div> </div> </div>i was thinking on allowing her the power. but after the fall of the horizon, she can save some of the mages but by sacrificing her own arete","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T15:45:10-08:00","id":1028718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1028688-i-might-have-fucked-up-i-need-advices-asap?p=1028692#post1028692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> i was thinking on allowing her the power. but after the fall of the horizon, she can save some of the mages but by sacrificing her own arete</div> </div> </div> </div>That's depending on her altruism vs. her desire for power and how that's communicated to and through her character. I would never rely on a PC doing EXACTLY what I intend in EXACTLY the way I intend it. Hell, having Arete 7 means she has a LOT of leeway in what she can use her magic to accomplish now. Like.... say...... saving people from a falling Chantry or the like.<br /> <br /> Honestly, I'd probably have an angel with a flaming sword show up and take her off to Eden... After all that's where the Apple was supposed to be. And now, effectively SHE is the Apple. It's a total cover your angelic ass maneuver...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"",